{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "2dc5cfb77423478b9068e9447c071156",
    "m_Title": "Outline: the static border",
    "m_Content": "WHAT IT DOES\nDraws a fixed outline around the sprite. This one does not move with the dissolve, it is always there.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n1. Step(edge = OutlineThickness x 0.1, in = Main Tex G) gives a hard on/off inner shape.\n2. Main Tex A (the full silhouette) minus that inner shape leaves a ring at the border.\n3. Ring x OutlineColor = the outline colour.\n4. Added on top of the Dissolve Edge result. That sum is the final Base Color.\n\nBoth this group and Dissolve Edge share OutlineColor and OutlineThickness, so one setting changes the border and the burn rim together.",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 5,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": 1683.0,
        "y": -619.0,
        "width": 1624.0,
        "height": 370.06500244140627
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "fffd1e1a60f942cabc6e4885a91f6715"
    }
}

